# Cloudflare Pages custom headers — https://developers.cloudflare.com/pages/configuration/headers/
# Mirrors the security posture already enforced on vpn.meshwg.com (see
# deploy/Caddyfile in the controller repo), adapted to what this static
# site actually loads: Google Fonts (style/font) + a same-origin
# self-hosted analytics script+beacon at /p/*. No third-party script
# origins, no iframes, no forms.
#
# script-src/style-src need 'unsafe-inline': Astro's `inlineStylesheets:
# 'auto'` inlines critical CSS as <style> blocks, and a few components
# use small inline <script is:inline>/define:vars snippets (scroll-reveal,
# pricing constants) with no server to mint per-request nonces on a fully
# static site. Hash-pinning each one would be more precise but silently
# breaks on any edit to that markup — not worth the fragility for a
# content site with no auth and no user data.
/*
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000; includeSubDomains; preload
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=(), payment=(), usb=()
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; script-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline' https://fonts.googleapis.com; font-src 'self' https://fonts.gstatic.com; img-src 'self' data:; connect-src 'self'; frame-ancestors 'none'; base-uri 'self'; form-action 'self'; object-src 'none'
